      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should be changing the layout of the device, since this mapping was done according to the Android specifications. That said, there is a valid point that the mappings are confusing. We should probably introduce the concept of \"north/south/easy/west\" to deal with this (as suggested by Patrick earlier). It\u0027s not clear how the backwards compatibility would work in this case, though. Looking forward to ppls feedback / thoughts here.",
